+# v1.5.14 实现追踪
+
+## TCC / H1
+- `desktop/install.command`
+  - stable custom DR
+  - one-time weak H1 repair
+  - literal requirement `=` prefix
+  - `codesign -R` pre/post verification
+  - receipts / rollback / routine Host immutability
+- `desktop/verify_mac_smoke.command`
+  - v1.5.14 receipt/version/H1 identity/TCC continuity gate
+- `desktop/app/src/context/running-host-identity.js`
+  - v1514/v1513/v1512 receipt fallback
+
+## Browser transport
+- `chrome_extension/background.js`
+  - always-on HTTP command long-poll
+  - requestId running/done dedup
+- `desktop/app/src/bridge/native-server.js`
+  - command health + circuit breaker
+- `desktop/app/src/main.js`
+  - 350ms Native-first hedge
+  - same requestId Native + HTTP
+
+## Automated tests
+- `tests/test_v1514_stable_h1_identity_repair.js`
+- `tests/test_v1514_browser_transport_hedge.js`
+- `tests/test_v1514_native_command_circuit.js`
+- `tests/test_v1514_delivery_version_contract.js`
+
+## 保留回归
+其余 v1.5.x 全部已有测试继续参与全量回归，覆盖窗口目标、visual scope、权限 no-loop、附件、outside click、只读、H1 runtime integrity 等。
